That's why the only one who's at a loss here is my late sister.

173
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:21,140
She married Dae Seong who had nothing, and just struggled, struggled and struggled.

174
00:23:21,140 --> 00:23:24,900
And then as soon as things were starting to look up, she fell ill.

175
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:29,290
Then she just. Left the world! Goodness...

176
00:23:29,290 --> 00:23:32,280
I can only go somewhere if I have somewhere to go.

177
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:36,490
This is all all my father's fault.

178
00:23:36,490 --> 00:23:40,350
