00:24:30,370 --> 00:24:33,850
This is the debut album of

186
00:24:33,850 --> 00:24:39,030
Korean violinist, Kyung Wha Chung. It's my favorite album.

187
00:24:40,390 --> 00:24:46,530
Did you know how old Kyung Wha Chung was when she recorded her first Tchaikovsky piece?

188
00:24:46,530 --> 00:24:52,210
Oh those. Those are my second favorite albums.

189
00:24:52,210 --> 00:24:57,210
That's my favorite-

