218
00:29:43,220 --> 00:29:47,460
Is that so? Okay, understood. Do your work.

219
00:29:49,600 --> 00:29:53,710
Hello! Yes, yes.

220
00:29:53,710 --> 00:29:56,790
I called you because of the blessings prayer. Yes.

221
00:29:56,790 --> 00:29:59,900
Please look after us well this time too.

222
00:30:00,940 --> 00:30:05,730
Huh? I mean, I could only write something if I had the talent.

223
00:30:05,730 --> 00:30:10,990
If you only write the way you've been doing, I will read it well.

224
00:30:10,990 --> 00:30:14,160
