240
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:10,890
I definitely remember going with Father to the house where you and your mom lived.

241
00:32:10,890 --> 00:32:14,370
And also I definitely remember taking out that fairy tale book out of your bookshelf and reading it.

242
00:32:14,370 --> 00:32:18,210
Yeah! The sweet potatoes your mom had baked then were really good too.

243
00:32:18,210 --> 00:32:21,860
