245
00:32:24,820 --> 00:32:29,030
The children should be called to experience all that's in the fairytales.

246
00:32:29,030 --> 00:32:31,080
Isnt it wicked?

247
00:32:32,170 --> 00:32:34,780
Is it not?

248
00:32:34,780 --> 00:32:40,650
